# Inbox · receiver package

Install on a desk surface (`-ins inbox`). Mints a **Receive.address** on the instance.
Hermes (later) mails **chips** to that address. Listener (later) paints you've-got-mail.

Foundation props only — wording may grow (mail, letters, leaves).
